	(text "GND_24V: 24 V return (XT30 pin 2, relay outputs,\nsensor 0 V, TVS, bulk caps, DC/DC input side).\nGND: logic (module, INA226, ADS1232, DC/DC output).\nNT1: the only joint between them (the INA226s\nmeasure +24V against GND). Place it at the DC/DC."
